      "transcript": "Australian has been worried that it is isolated from North America and uk. But since China became the second largest exporter after Japan, Asia became Australia's best export destination and Australia finally found its own place. In recent years, the rise of China has changed the world situation and influenced Australia as well. Australia should take advantage of China's rise.",
