      "sampleAudioTranscript": "The lecture mainly discusses the role of fatherhood in parenting. It explains that fathers play a crucial part in helping children feel safe. First, the speaker mentioned that this sense of security allows kids to take risks, which is important for developing their independence and autonomy. Then, I heard about how these experiences help children grow into responsible and compassionate citizens. For example, the talk showed a picture of hands holding a baby to highlight this care. Overall, the talk highlighted the importance of fatherhood in shaping confident children."
